    text: "Everything\u2026 is gone."
  - speakerName: Calepher
    portrait: {fileID: 6190399767430536486, guid: ca7e5ea20566a47bdb5f761ed46f7afa, type: 3}
    text: "Did they\u2026 take everything?"
