--- !u!114 &2011909523
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2011909519}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6732ee9b1ea9649d081a2422e68ddf5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  lines:
  - speakerName: '"???"'
    portrait: {fileID: -7214185816223905464, guid: d57435adfc2964f249728851ad257098, type: 3}
    text: "You\u2019ve made it this far\u2026 farther than I expected."
  - speakerName: Calepher
    portrait: {fileID: -7446026091647042388, guid: af5e1c8c0ed6d47a3bf7e8b0867d7752, type: 3}
    text: "Blue\u2026 it still exists."
  - speakerName: '"???"'
    portrait: {fileID: -7214185816223905464, guid: d57435adfc2964f249728851ad257098, type: 3}
    text: It never vanished. It was sealed within this staff, waiting for the right
      one.
  - speakerName: Calepher
    portrait: {fileID: -7446026091647042388, guid: af5e1c8c0ed6d47a3bf7e8b0867d7752, type: 3}
    text: What lies ahead?
  - speakerName: '"???"'
    portrait: {fileID: -7214185816223905464, guid: d57435adfc2964f249728851ad257098, type: 3}
    text: "Something far more brutal.\nWhat you are about to face\u2026 cannot be
      crossed on foot."
  - speakerName: '"???"'
    portrait: {fileID: -7214185816223905464, guid: d57435adfc2964f249728851ad257098, type: 3}
    text: "Blue is \u201Cthe path.\u201D\nIt is the sight of an exit\u2014and the
      burden of choice."
  - speakerName: Calepher
    portrait: {fileID: -7446026091647042388, guid: af5e1c8c0ed6d47a3bf7e8b0867d7752, type: 3}
    text: "\u2026Then give it to me."
  - speakerName: '"???"'
    portrait: {fileID: -7214185816223905464, guid: d57435adfc2964f249728851ad257098, type: 3}
    text: Prove that you seek not power, but to protect. Go. Carry the last of the
      blue...
